# Feature: File & image management

- Frontend may preview selected images locally before upload (FileReader is
  for preview only, never storage).
- Upload binaries via multipart/form-data directly to API/storage service;
  never store base64 in normal entity JSON.
- Enforce maximum one active primary image per `DesignId`.
- Component-wise images supported: Body, Pallu, Border, Blouse, Sleeve,
  Top Front/Back, Bottom, Dupatta, etc.
- Supported technical file types: PDF, PNG/JPG/WebP, EMB, DST and other
  embroidery formats required by operations.
- Validate file extension, MIME type, actual content signature where
  possible, size limit, and authorization before accepting an upload.

## Size limits
| Category | Limit | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Product/reference image | 10 MB each | Multiple; create thumbnails |
| Sketch PDF/image | 25 MB | Versioned |
| EMB/DST punching file | 50 MB | Keep original filename and checksum |
| Video reference | 200 MB | Prefer object storage/streaming |
| Audio note | 25 MB | Metadata stored; user permissions apply |

## API
- `POST /api/designs/{id}/images` - upload/register a product or component image.
